  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UWsTm2svK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"376\" height=\"110\"></a></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">全新的 Discord 服务器！用于私人支持和更新通知。</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>更新 (0.0.35) 为您的 Minecraft 服务器带来了新的天空村庄！高风村（Highwind Village）现已在更新中推出，仅限 1.20.1 或 1.21.1 版本可用。</strong></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1441/164/highwindvillage-jpeg.jpeg\" alt=\"1\" width=\"1500\" height=\"708\"></strong></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1441/166/highwind-village-3-jpeg.jpeg\" alt=\"2\" width=\"1500\" height=\"753\"></strong></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1441/167/highwind-village-4-jpeg.jpeg\" alt=\"4\" width=\"1500\" height=\"769\"></strong></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1441/165/highwind-village-1-jpeg.jpeg\" alt=\"6\" width=\"1500\" height=\"746\"></strong></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>详细描述：</strong></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>Create: Sky Village</strong></span> <span style=\"color:#fff\">是一款独特的 Minecraft 模组，真正提升了您的建造和探索体验——字面意义上的提升！该模组会在高空生成宏伟的浮空村庄，带来全新的冒险层级。利用 <em>Create</em> 模组的机械智慧来穿越、互动并扩展这些空中定居点。<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/970/56/638598725500886388.webp\" alt=\"create\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Fabric 版本需要安装 FABRIC API！</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意：</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">关于 Create 模组的 Bug，请前往 Create 模组的官方页面反馈。<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://github.com/Creators-of-Create/Create/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create GitHub 页面</a></span></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">简短<strong>描述：</strong></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">天空村庄</span>，<span style=\"color:#fff\">添加了一个在高空生成的村庄！所有建筑均由 Create 模组的建筑方块构成。</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">感谢 LuluBelleMC (YouTube) 展示该模组！</span></h1>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wQgtZm1qLwI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/293/9.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"1023\" height=\"172\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/970/133/minecraft-forge_-1.png\" alt=\"pic1\" width=\"1920\" height=\"967\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/290/intellij-idea-icon-512x512-ksbwsbbn.png\" alt=\"intelij\" width=\"235\" height=\"235\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">本模组使用 IntelliJ 开发</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">#AD</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">产品免责声明：非官方 Minecraft 产品。未经 Mojang 或 Microsoft 批准或关联。</span></h1>",
